RELATORIO-SESSAO.md
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/

# SegurosGPT is its own git repo (github.com/luciano-coelho/segurosGPT), nested here only for local dev access to the mock
segurosGPT/

# TLS session secrets (NSS keylog format: CLIENT_HANDSHAKE_TRAFFIC_SECRET etc.) -- decrypt the
# paired .pcap captures in the same directories; never committed, local-only / offline package only.
*.keylog

# Campaign raw data (pcaps/logs) -- stays local, packaged offline as .tar.gz/.tar.zst outside the
# repo; only its sha256+path+size is tracked in git (thesis/results/v9/campaign_oficial_conta_nova_raw_package.md).
thesis/results/v9/campaign_oficial_conta_nova_raw/
